  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Soderkoping - S&#xF6;derk&#xF6;ping</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">S&#xF6;derk&#xF6;pingsprocessen</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">S&#xF6;derk&#xF6;pingsprocessen har p&#xE5;g&#xE5;tt sedan 2001 d&#xE5; Migrationsverket bj&#xF6;d in Lit, Pol, Vit och Ukraina f&#xF6;r att diskutera migrationsfr&#xE5;gor. Processen har fortsatt. Denna insats inneb&#xE4;r ett seminarium d&#xE4;r 12 l&#xE4;nder skall delta f&#xF6;r att diskutera migrationsfr&#xE5;gor. Insatsen innefattar &#xE4;ven tv&#xE5; clusterm&#xF6;ten samt tv&#xE5; styrkommitt&#xE9;m&#xF6;ten. Syftet &#xE4;r att st&#xE4;rka det regionala samarbetet i omr&#xE5;det g&#xE4;llande migfr&#xE5;gor.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The S&#xF6;derk&#xF6;ping process started in 2001 in Sweden, the Swedish Migration Board invited four countries to discuss migration issues. This projects contains of one seminar to which 12 countries are invited, clustermeetings for different regions in the area and two steering committee meeting. The aim is to strengthen the regional cooperation in the area concerning migration issues.</narrative>
  </description>
